  "notes": "Per-member inventory per PR review: one event, the constructor, both AutofillEvent readonly attributes, and both AutofillEventInit fields \u2014 the complete surface of the WICG draft's IDL Index (RefillCallback and AutofillValueEntry are the types OF the inventoried members, not separate surface). Each member has a named contract row in #members (including AutofillEventInit.autofillValues, added for this contract) with the verbatim IDL in #syntax; availability in #context, dispatch timing in #lifecycle, and the draft's \u00a76 security text in #security-privacy. Single-page mapping (href '#'): the members are small enough that child routes would fragment a two-minute reference \u2014 the members table carries each member's substantive contract. Constructor errors are documented (not n/a) per PR review: #errors covers the standard Web IDL conversion TypeError for unconvertible init members, and the constructor has its own substantive row in #members."
